WEBVTT

00:00:58.292 --> 00:01:02.005
to work and send back money
to feed his family.

00:01:03.036 --> 00:01:06.868
Patrick never gave up his dream
of higher education.

00:01:06.892 --> 00:01:09.291
Late at night, after work,

00:01:09.315 --> 00:01:13.027
he surfed the net,
looking for ways to study.

00:01:13.827 --> 00:01:15.093
Meet Debbie.

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:16.983
Debbie is from Florida.

00:01:17.897 --> 00:01:22.046
Her parents didn't go to college,
and neither did any of her siblings.

00:01:22.706 --> 00:01:24.687
Debbie has worked all her life,

00:01:26.013 --> 00:01:29.823
pays taxes, supports herself
month to month,

00:01:29.847 --> 00:01:32.175
proud of the American dream,